<title>USA: FSA qualifies muni six issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies muni six issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSA said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following six municipal issues:</p>
<p>--Monticello, Iowa, $1.8 million GO capital loan bonds.</p>
<p>--Round Lake Park, Ill., $2.69 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Carver, Mass., $4.875 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Meramec SD #R-111, Mo., $2 million of school bonds.</p>
<p>--Averill Park Central School District, N.Y., $13 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Elmira Heights Central School District, N.Y., $4.61 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
